        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nepuonu Yeriko; ore epuo aaing'uaa Yeriko eiriamariyie ilooiteng'eni lenyena o lorora kitok, netii olmodooni oomonisho oji Bartimayo ole Timayo, oton te mbata e nkoitoi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pee ening eji Yesu le Nasaret ilo neiteru abuak eishiraki ajo, “Yesu, olayioni le Daudi, ing'urrieki!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebuaaki ilkumok aajoki metigirayu; kake etabuaa oleng ejo, “Olayioni le Daudi, ing'urrieki nanu!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitashe Yesu nejo, “Empoto.” Neipoti ilo tung'ani modooni aajoki, “Intagoluoyu; inyo amu kimpot ninye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nenang'aa olkila lenye, neipid nelo enetii Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neng'amaa Yesu ajoki, “Kaa iyieu naaitaas?” Nejoki ilo modooni, “Lo kitok kayieu nadolishoyu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Yesu, “Shomo, kinchiunye enkirukoto ino.” Nedolishoyu ina kata ake neirukurukore te nkoitoi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.52"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
